return {
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【好友-删除拉黑】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-好友-点击头像</>、\n<Assistant_Title2>好友删除：</>删除好友会双向解除好友关系，不再会在好友列表中显示。<Assistant_Red>删除好友会清空双方的好友度，无法恢复</>，请谨慎操作。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友拉黑：</>若双方为好友关系，则拉黑会自动双向解除好友关系，且拉黑后无法再接收到对方的私聊。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}，{SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}，{SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}，{SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Delete/Block】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry:</><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends - Click Avatar</>, \n<Assistant_Title2>Delete Friend:</>Deleting a friend will mutually remove the friendship, and they will no longer appear in your friend list.<Assistant_Red>Deleting a friend will clear the friendship level for both parties and cannot be recovered</>, please be Cautious.\n<Assistant_Title2>Block Friend:</>If you are currently friends, blocking will automatically remove the friendship on both sides, and you will no longer receive private messages from that person after blocking.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendship Level]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【高原战】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>高原战</>是势力战中的<Assistant_Red>800人</>战场。战场资格会在每轮四方联赛第一场结束后<Assistant_Red>21:00</>分配，获得资格的俱乐部成员可在<Assistant_System>以战养战-势力-高原战</>界面查看赛程安排。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心目标：</>各势力需要争夺战场中央平台上的<Assistant_Property1>死亡骑士</>。死亡骑士会跟随身边<Assistant_Red>20米</>内非凡者数量最多的势力，且获得跟随至少需要<Assistant_Red>5人</>。死亡骑士身边的势力会定时增加势力积分，获得死亡骑士跟随的势力加分更高。\n<Assistant_Title2>胜利规则：</>成功将死亡骑士送达本阵营广场，可额外获得<Assistant_Red>1200势力积分</>。达到<Assistant_Red>15000势力积分</>的势力会提前获胜；战斗结束时，会根据四皇势力积分排名发放不同档次奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>劣势机制：</>与第一名相差<Assistant_Red>3000势力积分</>的势力会被视为劣势势力。每<Assistant_Red>5分钟</>，劣势势力广场前会投放<Assistant_Property1>绊马索</>，只有本势力非凡者可以拾取，使用后可减速死亡骑士；每<Assistant_Red>8分钟</>，劣势势力广场会开启集合传送，需要<Assistant_Red>1名</>非凡者前往广场区域激活，成功后该势力所有非凡者可传送至广场区域并获得强力buff。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往高原战]|1250323}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Highland Battle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</><Assistant_System>Highland Battle</> is an <Assistant_Red>800-player</> battlefield in the Faction War. Battlefield eligibility is assigned at <Assistant_Red>21:00</> after the first match of each round of the Four-Way League. Club members who have obtained eligibility can view the schedule in the <Assistant_System>War-Driven Growth - Faction - Highland Battle</> interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective:</>Each faction needs to compete for the <Assistant_Property1>Death Knight</> on the central platform of the battlefield. The Death Knight will follow the faction with the most Beyonders within <Assistant_Red>20 meters</>, and at least <Assistant_Red>5 people</> are required to obtain the follow. Factions near the Death Knight will periodically gain faction points, and the faction followed by the Death Knight gains more points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Victory Rules:</>Successfully delivering the Death Knight to your faction's plaza grants an additional <Assistant_Red>1200 faction points</>. The faction that reaches <Assistant_Red>15000 faction points</> wins early; when the battle ends, rewards of different tiers are distributed based on the faction point ranking.\n<Assistant_Title2>Disadvantage Mechanism:</>Factions with a difference of <Assistant_Red>3000 faction points</> from the first place are considered disadvantaged. Every <Assistant_Red>5 minutes</>, <Assistant_Property1>Tripwires</> will be dropped in front of the disadvantaged faction's plaza, which can only be picked up by Beyonders of that faction. Using them can slow down the Death Knight. Every <Assistant_Red>8 minutes</>, a group teleport will open at the disadvantaged faction's plaza, requiring <Assistant_Red>1</> Beyonder to go to the plaza area to activate it. Once successful, all Beyonders of that faction can teleport to the plaza area and gain a powerful buff.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to Highland Battle]|1250323}",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>翡绿羊绒・暗纹提花・保暖毛衫\n当迷雾散去时，旅人会发现脚下的路比想象中更柔软，原来绿野不只存在于传说里。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Emerald Cashmere · Dark Pattern Jacquard · Warm Sweater\nWhen the fog clears, the traveler will find that the road under their feet is softer than imagined; it turns out that the green fields do not only exist in legends.",
