    ["　　收到你的来信，我已从间海郡回到贝克兰德。多日的离别本就让我的心中燃烧痛苦的火焰，你所说的话语更是增添我的绝望。\n　　请不要怀疑我们之间情谊的程度，如果你要怀疑，就请看着我的眼睛再说出这些狠心的话语。\n　　我已在我们熟悉的餐厅订好一周的座位，不管如何，我每天都会在这里等你，请来见我吧。"] = "Received your letter; I have returned to Backlund from Intis. The days of separation were already burning a flame of pain in my heart, and your words have only added to my despair.\nPlease do not doubt the depth of our affection. If you must doubt it, please look into my eyes and say these cruel words again.\nI have booked a table at our familiar restaurant for a week. No matter what, I will be waiting for you there every day. Please come and see me.",
